<title>PHILIPPINES: Asian Dev Bank clears $50.5-mln loans to Mongolia.</title>
<headline>Asian Dev Bank clears $50.5-mln loans to Mongolia.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Asian Development Bank said on Thursday it cleared various loans to Mongolia totalling $50.5 million loans.</p>
<p>About $35 million will go to restructure Mongolia's banking sector and restore confidence after two of its largest banks closed.</p>
<p>Some $15.5 million worth of loans will be used to reform Mongolia's educational system, the ADB said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
